                <mxCell id="c1076" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#212121;" value="&lt;b&gt;WIRING LIST&lt;/b&gt; · every connection, hole to hole (top view). White = underside, blue = top-side insulated wire (numbered on the drawing), yellow = off-board cable." vertex="1">
